\sigma_{11}^{\alpha}=\frac{\hbar e^{2}}{VN}\sum_{\boldsymbol{q}\boldsymbol{p}}\left|f^{\alpha}\left(\boldsymbol{p}+\boldsymbol{q},\boldsymbol{q}\right)\right|^{2}\int\frac{d\epsilon}{\pi}\left[\int\frac{dz}{\pi}B\left(\boldsymbol{p}-\boldsymbol{q},\epsilon-z\right)A\left(\boldsymbol{p},z\right)\left(n_{B}\left(\epsilon-z\right)+n_{F}\left(-z\right)\right)\right]A\left(\boldsymbol{q},\epsilon\right)\left(-\frac{\partial n_{F}\left(\epsilon\right)}{\partial\epsilon}\right)
\]

