\sigma_{11}^{\alpha}=\left(\frac{2a_{z}}{a_{pl}^{2}}\frac{e^{2}}{\hbar}\right)2\left[\frac{4g^{2}}{U}\right]^{2}\int\frac{d\epsilon}{\pi}\rho\left(\epsilon\right)\left(-\frac{\partial n_{F}\left(\epsilon\right)}{\partial\epsilon}\right)\int\frac{dz}{\pi}\rho\left(\epsilon-z\right)B\left(z\right)\left(n_{B}\left(z\right)+n_{F}\left(z-\epsilon\right)\right)
\]

